I enter the building compound.
I am carrying three cloth bags.
These bags are very heavy.
I am tired.
Now I only want rest.
My neighbour Asha is also there.
She sees me.
She quickly comes near me.
She asks me, "Maya, are the bags heavy?"
I say, "Yes, I want help."
Asha quickly takes one bag.
That bag is the biggest.
We go upstairs.
She is a good friend.
I like Asha very much.
I also like her help.
I say to her, "Asha, thank you very much."
She smiles.
